Sampling     : 03:30, 04:30, 05:30 IST

PART B: MODIS TERRA NIGHTTIME LAND SURFACE TEMPERATURE
Dataset      : MODIS/061/MOD11A1
Bands        : LST_Night_1km, QC_Night

OUTPUTS:
Figure 3  : Annual ERA5 nighttime air temperature trend
